## KEY FILE LOCATIONS
- `domain/model/Models.kt`: Central domain entities.
- `data/local/Migrations.kt`: Database evolution logic.
- `data/repository/BaseRepository.kt`: Sync logic base class.
- `app/ui/theme/Theme.kt`: Color palette and typography.
